## 📊 METRIC DEPENDENCY TREE

```
DENOMINATOR BASES (Foundation - All other metrics depend on these):
│
├─ PR_COUNT (ag.prcount) - Total PRs created/opened
│  │
│  ├─ PR_MERGED% = (ag.prmergedcount / ag.prcount) × 100
│  ├─ PR_OPEN% = (ag.openprcount / ag.prcount) × 100
│  ├─ PR_LARGE% = (ag.largesizeprcount / ag.prcount) × 100
│  ├─ PR_LARGE_DYNAMIC% = (ag.largesizeprcount_dynamic / ag.prcount) × 100
│  ├─ REVIEW_TIME = SUM(reviewtime) / ag.prcount
│  ├─ MERGE_TIME = SUM(deploytime) / ag.prcount
│  ├─ CYCLE_TIME = SUM(cycletime) / ag.prcount
│  ├─ CODING_TIME = SUM(codingtime) / ag.prcount
│  ├─ DEPLOYMENT_FREQUENCY = ag.deploymentfrequency / ag.prcount
│  ├─ PR_REVIEWED% = ((ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount) / ag.prcount) × 100
│  └─ PR_UNREVIEWED% = (ag.unreviewedprcount / ag.prcount) × 100
│
├─ COMMIT_LINES_MODIFIED (ag.commitlinesmodified) - Total lines added + removed
│  │
│  ├─ NEW_WORK% = (ag.newwork / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100
│  ├─ REWORK% = (ag.rework / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100
│  └─ MAINTENANCE% = (ag.maintenancework / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100
│
├─ PR_REVIEWED_COUNT (ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount) - PRs that went through review
│  │
│  └─ FLASHY_REVIEWS% = (ag.flashyreviewedprcount / (ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount)) × 100
│
├─ DEPLOYMENT_COUNT (ag.deploymentfrequency) - Total deployments
│  │
│  └─ CFR% = (ag.hotfixprcount / ag.deploymentfrequency) × 100
│
└─ HOTFIX_PR_COUNT (ag.hotfixprcount) - Count of hotfix PRs
   │
   └─ MTTR = SUM(ag.prmttrduration) / ag.hotfixprcount
```

