## 🔒 CRITICAL CONSTRAINT GROUPS

### GROUP 1: CODE DISTRIBUTION (MUST SUM TO 100%)
```
NEW_WORK% + REWORK% + MAINTENANCE% = 100% ± 1%

FORMULAS:
  NEW_WORK% = (ag.newwork / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100
  REWORK% = (ag.rework / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100
  MAINTENANCE% = (ag.maintenancework / ag.commitlinesmodified) × 100

CONSTRAINT:
  ag.newwork + ag.rework + ag.maintenancework = ag.commitlinesmodified

VALIDATION:
  IF sum ≠ ag.commitlinesmodified:
    IF sum < ag.commitlinesmodified:
      # Unaccounted lines - add to new work
      ag.newwork += (ag.commitlinesmodified - sum)
    ELSE:
      # Overcounted - ERROR
      RAISE "Components exceed total"

COLUMNS AFFECTED:
  - ag.newwork
  - ag.rework
  - ag.maintenancework
  - ag.commitlinesmodified
```

### GROUP 2: PR REVIEW STATUS (MUST SUM TO 100%)
```
PR_REVIEWED% + PR_UNREVIEWED% = 100% ± 1%

FORMULAS:
  PR_REVIEWED% = ((ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount) / ag.prcount) × 100
  PR_UNREVIEWED% = (ag.unreviewedprcount / ag.prcount) × 100

CONSTRAINT:
  ag.unreviewedprcount ≤ ag.prcount

VALIDATION:
  IF ag.unreviewedprcount > ag.prcount:
    ag.unreviewedprcount = ag.prcount

COLUMNS AFFECTED:
  - ag.prcount
  - ag.unreviewedprcount
```

### GROUP 3: FLASHY REVIEWS SUBSET (MUST BE ≤ REVIEWED)
```
FLASHY_REVIEWS ≤ PR_REVIEWED

FORMULA:
  FLASHY_REVIEWS% = (ag.flashyreviewedprcount / (ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount)) × 100

CONSTRAINT:
  ag.flashyreviewedprcount ≤ (ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount)

VALIDATION:
  reviewed_count = ag.prcount - ag.unreviewedprcount
  IF ag.flashyreviewedprcount > reviewed_count:
    ag.flashyreviewedprcount = reviewed_count

COLUMNS AFFECTED:
  - ag.flashyreviewedprcount
  - ag.prcount
  - ag.unreviewedprcount
```

### GROUP 4: TIME COMPOSITION (CYCLE TIME)
```
CYCLE_TIME ≈ CODING_TIME + REVIEW_TIME + MERGE_TIME (±10% variance allowed)

FORMULAS:
  CYCLE_TIME = SUM(pr.cycletimeduration) / ag.prcount
  CODING_TIME = SUM(pr.codingtime) / ag.prcount
  REVIEW_TIME = SUM(pr.reviewtime) / ag.prcount
  MERGE_TIME = SUM(pr.deploytime) / ag.prcount

TIME BOUNDARIES (minutes):
  CODING_TIME: 0-1440 (0-24 hours)
  REVIEW_TIME: 0-1440 (0-24 hours)
  MERGE_TIME: 0-1440 (0-24 hours)
  CYCLE_TIME: 0-4320 (0-3 days)
  MTTR: 0-10080 (0-7 days)

VALIDATION:
  calculated_sum = CODING_TIME + REVIEW_TIME + MERGE_TIME
  variance = ABS(CYCLE_TIME - calculated_sum) / CYCLE_TIME
  IF variance > 0.10:
    WARNING: "Time components don't match cycle time"
```

### GROUP 5: DORA METRICS (CFR & MTTR)
```
CFR% = (ag.hotfixprcount / ag.deploymentfrequency) × 100
MTTR = SUM(ag.prmttrduration) / ag.hotfixprcount

CONSTRAINTS:
  ag.hotfixprcount ≤ ag.deploymentfrequency (CFR ≤ 100%)
  ag.hotfixprcount ≤ ag.prcount
  ag.deploymentfrequency > 0 (for CFR calculation)
  ag.hotfixprcount > 0 (for MTTR calculation)

VALIDATION:
  IF ag.hotfixprcount > ag.deploymentfrequency:
    ag.hotfixprcount = ag.deploymentfrequency
  
  IF ag.hotfixprcount = 0:
    MTTR = 0 (or undefined)
    CFR% = 0%

COLUMNS AFFECTED:
  - ag.hotfixprcount
  - ag.deploymentfrequency
  - ag.prmttrduration
```

