**Auto-Fix:**
```python
if NEW_hotfixprcount > ag.deploymentfrequency:
    ag.hotfixprcount = ag.deploymentfrequency
if NEW_hotfixprcount > ag.prcount:
    ag.hotfixprcount = ag.prcount
if NEW_hotfixprcount = 0:
